WEBVTT

00:07.465 --> 00:09.467
[opening theme music playing]

00:12.220 --> 00:13.763
[wind gusting]

00:37.871 --> 00:41.875
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE 2

00:44.085 --> 00:45.962
[stirring music playing]

00:46.046 --> 00:48.048
[gulping]

01:22.165 --> 01:23.958
[Chae-ok] It's the same symptoms
every time.

01:24.834 --> 01:25.835
An insatiable hunger

01:25.919 --> 01:28.171
after extreme blood loss
or physical exertion.

01:32.967 --> 01:34.469
[creature voice echoes] I need to feed.

01:37.097 --> 01:38.640
I need to feed.

01:42.310 --> 01:45.897
Feed me! I'm hungry. I need to feed.

01:48.399 --> 01:50.610
I need to feed!

01:55.323 --> 01:56.157
[man gasps]

01:56.783 --> 01:58.868
- [man screaming]
- [people clamoring]

02:02.580 --> 02:05.291
[man groaning]

02:12.132 --> 02:13.550
[Chae-ok] I'm too dangerous.

02:14.926 --> 02:16.261
[music fades]

02:17.345 --> 02:18.346
[breathes heavily]

02:20.390 --> 02:21.432
[clattering]

02:31.776 --> 02:33.778
[pensive music playing]

02:36.197 --> 02:38.199
[squelching]

02:42.871 --> 02:43.913
[groans]

02:49.252 --> 02:50.295
[groans]

02:57.677 --> 03:00.680
[breathing heavily]

03:10.857 --> 03:12.609
[wistful music playing]

03:22.285 --> 03:25.580
Now you'll have good luck.
Let's hope for the best, Chae-ok.

03:25.663 --> 03:27.665
[wistful music continues]

03:43.765 --> 03:45.767
- [kicking]
- [whimpers]

03:47.477 --> 03:49.479
[breathing heavily]

04:14.170 --> 04:15.463
[music fades]

04:22.136 --> 04:25.473
BUGANG COMPANY
VICE PRESIDENT JANG HO-JAE

04:25.556 --> 04:27.558
[wistful music playing]

04:29.310 --> 04:33.189
CALL ME

04:48.246 --> 04:49.914
BUGANG COMPANY

05:16.899 --> 05:20.403
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN MEMORY AND OBLIVION

05:20.486 --> 05:24.407
EPISODE 3
PIECES OF MEMORIES

05:24.490 --> 05:25.491
[music fades]

05:25.575 --> 05:30.246
BUGANG COMPANY

05:42.592 --> 05:43.509
Have a seat.

05:56.147 --> 05:59.984
Something to drink? Coffee?
Or do you want something else?

06:01.736 --> 06:02.779
Let's get down to business.

06:06.491 --> 06:07.992
Why don't we begin with introductions?

06:09.994 --> 06:12.205
[sighs] I already told you my name.

06:12.288 --> 06:13.498
So what's yours?

06:15.583 --> 06:17.168
Well, I have no name, so…

06:17.251 --> 06:20.129
If we're partnering on this,
shouldn't I know your name at least?

06:20.213 --> 06:23.091
We should skip the details.
We're partners.

06:23.174 --> 06:25.676
- That's all you need to know.
- [scoffs, chuckles]

06:29.055 --> 06:29.889
How's your injury?

06:32.350 --> 06:33.309
Are you okay?

06:35.561 --> 06:38.940
You were hurt… pretty bad the other night.

06:40.942 --> 06:41.901
[Chae-ok sighs]

06:44.070 --> 06:45.780
I wanna set two rules moving forward.

06:47.407 --> 06:49.367
Don't ask personal questions, and

06:50.576 --> 06:51.953
you have to do whatever I tell you.

06:52.036 --> 06:53.037
[scoffs]

06:53.704 --> 06:54.539
[chuckles]

06:54.622 --> 06:57.166
So you wanna work together,
but you won't tell me what your name is

06:57.250 --> 06:59.043
or whether I should still
be worried about you?

06:59.127 --> 07:01.629
Let's begin with calling
Madam Na's cell phone, all right?

07:02.296 --> 07:03.423
What's the point? She's dead.

07:04.090 --> 07:06.092
Well, the murderer called me
from her number.

07:06.843 --> 07:08.803
He was the last person to see her and

07:10.054 --> 07:10.888
request a job.

07:10.972 --> 07:12.473
[mysterious music playing]

07:15.309 --> 07:16.727
[Ho-jae] What was the job?

07:29.824 --> 07:31.826
[stirring music playing]

07:31.909 --> 07:32.827
Does he look familiar?

08:02.690 --> 08:03.691
[Seung-jo] What's this?

08:04.859 --> 08:07.361
Aren't you on probation?
Why are you roaming around?

08:07.445 --> 08:08.446
Seriously?

08:09.447 --> 08:11.782
Am I supposed to be rotting away
inside of my room, then?

08:11.866 --> 08:13.159
If that is what it takes

08:13.242 --> 08:15.953
to keep a variable like you
out of trouble, then so be it.

08:19.415 --> 08:20.708
Always so obedient.

08:24.587 --> 08:27.256
You're in charge
of keeping us all under control here.

08:29.425 --> 08:30.635
But why do you do it?

08:31.511 --> 08:33.012
Afraid we'll become a threat?

08:34.013 --> 08:36.265
So is that why you operated on Ho-jae?

08:37.558 --> 08:38.768
He was out of control.

08:41.062 --> 08:42.605
He started to get in the way.

08:47.026 --> 08:48.277
He was quite annoying.

08:49.028 --> 08:49.862
That's why.

08:52.782 --> 08:55.159
But do you really think
you can control all of us?

08:55.243 --> 08:57.912
I know how to control
that little Najin inside of your brain.

08:57.995 --> 08:59.830
Does that answer your question at all?

09:03.709 --> 09:05.461
Go back to your quarters, Seung-jo.

09:08.548 --> 09:11.175
There's someone out there like us.

09:16.806 --> 09:18.140
[phone buzzing]

09:21.394 --> 09:22.353
SILVERBILL

09:22.436 --> 09:23.312
Look, it's her.

09:29.068 --> 09:29.902
Silverbill.

09:30.403 --> 09:32.196
[Ho-jae] I heard you were looking for me.

09:33.489 --> 09:34.740
Do we know each other?

09:35.366 --> 09:36.242
What do you want?

09:37.493 --> 09:38.869
Is she with you right now?

09:42.248 --> 09:43.457
[laughs] That's wild.

09:44.792 --> 09:48.546
I guess she is one of us, then.
She's still alive after all that.

09:49.922 --> 09:51.424
What do you mean by that?

09:52.091 --> 09:53.718
Oh, I'm sure you have an idea.

09:53.801 --> 09:57.680
Well, I'm asking because I have no idea
what you're talking about. So tell me.

09:59.849 --> 10:01.017
What's going on here?

10:03.060 --> 10:04.186
[disconnect tone]

10:06.022 --> 10:06.856
[scoffs]

10:19.327 --> 10:21.495
- Who was that?
- Ho-jae.

10:23.873 --> 10:25.207
He's with the lady.

10:26.417 --> 10:28.044
What do we do? Should I call him back?

10:28.127 --> 10:30.129
[music fades]

10:30.212 --> 10:31.047
No, let's wait.

10:33.049 --> 10:33.966
He said

10:34.884 --> 10:37.511
that you were one of them or something.

10:37.595 --> 10:39.680
What did he mean by that? Do you know?

10:40.723 --> 10:42.850
- [water burbling]
- [stirring music playing]

10:42.933 --> 10:45.811
You're… one of us, huh?

10:47.313 --> 10:48.397
No, I don't.

10:52.943 --> 10:54.111
[phone buzzes]

10:55.154 --> 10:57.198
MADAM NA
LET US MEET TONIGHT

10:57.281 --> 10:58.366
It's him again.

10:59.450 --> 11:00.326
He wants to meet.

11:05.956 --> 11:07.124
[phone buzzes]

11:08.334 --> 11:10.336
CHOOSE A LOCATION

11:15.383 --> 11:18.302
It's done. I have what I need. Stay here.

11:18.386 --> 11:19.512
"Stay here"?

11:20.179 --> 11:21.263
I'll do the rest by myself.

11:21.972 --> 11:23.099
Are you joking?

11:23.766 --> 11:26.143
I get us the meeting,
and you want me to stay here?

11:26.227 --> 11:29.021
Look, I'm the one
who's being falsely accused.

11:29.522 --> 11:31.357
He wants to meet with me, so I'm going.

11:31.440 --> 11:34.276
Believe me when I say it's better
if you don't tag along tonight.

11:36.237 --> 11:39.824
There are some things in life
that you're better off not knowing at all.

11:41.659 --> 11:42.952
If you get involved…

11:45.579 --> 11:46.956
it'll make your life a living hell.

11:49.041 --> 11:51.210
Trust me.
I've dealt with these types before.

11:51.293 --> 11:52.670
So just sit this one out.

11:54.505 --> 11:56.590
I'm not sure if you're worried
or trying to scare me.

11:56.674 --> 11:58.509
Just hoping to dissuade you.

12:00.678 --> 12:02.221
You don't know what you're getting into.

12:02.304 --> 12:03.764
Why don't we call the police, then?

12:03.848 --> 12:06.851
If we wanna catch him,
then we can't make a big scene out of it.

12:08.310 --> 12:10.020
The moment he finds out
we called the police,

12:10.104 --> 12:11.355
he won't show up at all.

12:13.232 --> 12:14.650
Then we're back to square one.

12:14.734 --> 12:16.485
He's looking for me, all right?

12:16.986 --> 12:19.905
He doesn't wanna meet you.
He wants to meet me, so I'm going.

12:19.989 --> 12:22.783
Don't be brave just because you can.
It doesn't make you a hero.

12:22.867 --> 12:23.784
Say what you want,

12:23.868 --> 12:26.996
but I'm not the type who stands by
while others do my dirty work.

12:27.621 --> 12:29.582
[tender piano music playing]

12:29.665 --> 12:31.292
You wanted a partnership.

12:32.084 --> 12:33.043
So we're going together.

12:36.255 --> 12:37.548
[music fades]

12:37.631 --> 12:39.675
[man 1] So are they gonna meet up or what?

12:39.759 --> 12:43.012
Yes. I think they're meeting today
with the suspect who has Madam Na's phone.

12:43.095 --> 12:44.054
Where and what time?

12:44.138 --> 12:45.765
They didn't go into the details
about that,

12:45.848 --> 12:47.308
so I'm planning on tailing them.

12:47.391 --> 12:49.185
All right, I'm requesting backup for you.

12:49.268 --> 12:51.395
You follow them
as soon as they begin moving.

12:51.479 --> 12:53.147
Ho-jae, what's going on here?

12:53.230 --> 12:55.691
Who's upstairs? Where are you going now?

12:55.775 --> 12:57.860
She believes
the person who murdered Madam Na

12:57.943 --> 13:00.154
is the same person
from the motel incident.

13:00.237 --> 13:03.115
Then call the cops.
You don't need to go anywhere, so why go?

13:03.199 --> 13:04.992
[Ho-jae] If he knows
we called the cops on him,

13:05.075 --> 13:06.243
he'll just go into hiding.

13:06.327 --> 13:07.995
Then it would've been all for nothing.

13:08.078 --> 13:09.330
Oh yeah? Say's who?

13:09.413 --> 13:10.289
Says her.

13:10.790 --> 13:13.542
And you just believe everything
that woman says? You barely know her.

13:13.626 --> 13:15.211
Actually, we've met twice.

13:15.294 --> 13:16.962
Stop it. Hey.

13:18.506 --> 13:21.550
- Do you even know what her name is?
- Miss Silverbill?

13:21.634 --> 13:24.136
- What does she do?
- She finds missing people.

13:24.220 --> 13:25.971
I knew it. I knew it! Huh?

13:26.055 --> 13:28.724
She doesn't have a real job or title.
She might be playing you.

13:28.808 --> 13:31.393
And you're gonna listen to
whatever she says? What if she's lying?

13:31.477 --> 13:32.436
You must be insane.

13:33.395 --> 13:34.438
Could be, I guess.

13:34.522 --> 13:37.107
It's all strange.
Yet I still find myself believing her.

13:37.191 --> 13:40.611
Wha… You find her really attractive.
I'm right, aren't I?

13:40.694 --> 13:42.071
Hey, snap out of it, okay?

13:42.154 --> 13:44.824
I mean, she could be an accomplice
for all you know.

13:44.907 --> 13:47.117
What if you're the next person
they're planning to murder?

13:47.201 --> 13:49.703
Listen, her closest friend
was just killed, all right?

13:49.787 --> 13:51.789
Hyung, think from her perspective.

13:51.872 --> 13:55.334
What if I was murdered all of a sudden?
Wouldn't you lose your mind as well?

13:55.417 --> 13:57.795
Wait. Don't take my line
and throw it back at me.

13:58.295 --> 13:59.421
Don't convolute them with us.

13:59.505 --> 14:01.549
So would you lose your mind
if I was murdered?

14:01.632 --> 14:02.925
'Course I'd lose my mind!

14:03.008 --> 14:04.927
You'd drop everything
and search for the killer?

14:05.010 --> 14:06.387
I would do it in a heartbeat!

14:06.470 --> 14:08.848
- Will you be my backup tonight?
- Of course! I'll support--

14:08.931 --> 14:10.808
Thanks, buddy. [chuckles]

14:10.891 --> 14:13.811
Ah shit! You tricked me.
I'll get you. Seriously.

14:14.979 --> 14:16.564
You might wanna grab a sweater.

14:19.066 --> 14:20.442
- [door opens]
- Oh, wait.

14:21.652 --> 14:22.778
Three times already.

14:23.863 --> 14:25.614
I've met the woman three times now.

14:28.576 --> 14:30.578
[stirring music playing]

14:45.885 --> 14:47.052
[music fades]

14:47.928 --> 14:49.722
- [door opens]
- [woman] Is that you, Jong-hyeok?

14:49.805 --> 14:51.640
Yes, Grandma. I just got back.

14:53.809 --> 14:55.895
[grandma] Oh goodness!
Must've been a long day.

14:55.978 --> 14:58.731
- [Jong-hyeok] No, it was okay.
- Well, that's good to hear.

14:59.732 --> 15:01.108
[Jong-hyeok groans]

15:06.447 --> 15:07.656
[Jong-hyeok groans]

15:11.952 --> 15:13.203
[grunts]

15:13.287 --> 15:15.915
- Wash your hands before we have dinner.
- Okay.

15:17.124 --> 15:19.126
[grandma] You said
your training starts tomorrow?

15:19.209 --> 15:21.545
[Jong-hyeok] Yeah, it starts tomorrow
and goes for a month.

15:22.046 --> 15:24.131
[grandma] What kind of training
takes a full month?

15:24.214 --> 15:26.050
It's protocol for all new employees.

15:28.093 --> 15:29.303
Oh, Grandma, what's this?

15:30.054 --> 15:31.013
[grandma] Huh?

15:33.390 --> 15:36.143
What's it look like?
Well, it's a new suit.

15:36.769 --> 15:38.395
They gave me some bonus money. [laughs]

15:38.479 --> 15:40.272
Really? Is it from Madam Na?

15:40.356 --> 15:42.775
Uh, no. It's from Master Jang.

15:42.858 --> 15:45.194
Jang? Who?

15:45.277 --> 15:46.528
It's okay. [chuckles]

15:46.612 --> 15:48.530
Go ahead and sit. You must be hungry.

15:48.614 --> 15:49.531
Okay.

15:50.950 --> 15:51.992
[Jong-hyeok sighs]

15:59.249 --> 16:01.293
[Jong-hyeok] Whoa! This is so much food!

16:01.377 --> 16:03.379
AHN JONG-HYEOK, MULTI-SUPPORT TEAM
JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

16:03.462 --> 16:06.423
[grandma] After tomorrow, you won't
be able to have my food for a while. Eat.

16:06.507 --> 16:08.509
[unsettling music playing]

16:14.515 --> 16:17.059
[reverential music playing]

16:20.854 --> 16:23.023
[footsteps stomping]

16:26.860 --> 16:28.404
[ticking]

16:32.324 --> 16:34.326
[unsettling music playing]

16:42.001 --> 16:43.085
[music intensifies]

16:54.221 --> 16:56.223
[music fades]

17:05.983 --> 17:06.817
Hey, Ho-jae.

17:07.860 --> 17:09.737
I just have to say
that you don't have to do--

17:09.820 --> 17:11.030
I'll be right back.

17:11.989 --> 17:12.865
[Yong-gil] Uh…

17:13.365 --> 17:14.366
[car door closes]

17:16.285 --> 17:17.161
[sighs]

17:21.832 --> 17:23.250
[Chae-ok] Are you scared?

17:24.209 --> 17:26.045
Not at all. Are you?

17:31.216 --> 17:32.801
You've got some good gear.

17:32.885 --> 17:34.053
It's a two-way radio.

17:36.847 --> 17:37.765
Here, take this.

17:40.142 --> 17:42.728
If the situation gets bad,
throw it on the ground and run.

17:43.812 --> 17:45.147
It'll explode on its own.

17:47.858 --> 17:49.735
Where did you get all this equipment?

17:50.402 --> 17:52.780
Are you, like,
a former soldier or something?

17:52.863 --> 17:54.490
Or like a secret NIS agent?

17:55.532 --> 17:57.534
It's effective for two to three minutes,

17:58.160 --> 17:59.828
so stagger when you throw them.

17:59.912 --> 18:02.414
That should give you enough time
to get back to the car.

18:03.624 --> 18:05.250
Again with the mixed messages.

18:05.834 --> 18:07.836
Are you trying to scare me,
or are you worried?

18:09.171 --> 18:11.256
Just don't want us
slowing each other down.

18:16.220 --> 18:17.262
[baton clatters]

18:18.430 --> 18:20.432
[reverential music playing]

18:36.115 --> 18:38.534
By the way, I still don't know your name.

18:39.535 --> 18:42.121
Do you have some sort of
a hang-up about it or something?

18:43.580 --> 18:47.042
Or… some kind of secret you can't divulge?

18:51.171 --> 18:53.423
Ah, ah, Miss Silverbill?

18:55.092 --> 18:56.093
Can you hear me?

18:56.593 --> 18:57.845
Are you there?

18:57.928 --> 18:59.721
- Check, che--
- [Chae-ok] Let's focus, shall we?

19:02.891 --> 19:04.226
[gentle piano music playing]

19:04.309 --> 19:06.270
[Ho-jae] Okay. Roger that.

19:12.651 --> 19:13.485
[phone buzzes]

19:15.237 --> 19:16.488
[music fades]

19:18.240 --> 19:19.908
[stirring music playing]

19:19.992 --> 19:23.328
Looks like he's here already.
He wants me to go to floor R2.

19:26.540 --> 19:28.542
[unsettling music playing]

20:01.325 --> 20:02.659
[eerie chittering]

20:12.085 --> 20:14.087
[suspenseful music playing]

20:44.326 --> 20:45.953
[electrical crackle]

21:01.718 --> 21:03.095
[Ho-jae] Miss Silverbill,

21:03.178 --> 21:04.388
are you almost here?

21:05.681 --> 21:06.682
Where are you now?

21:08.350 --> 21:09.351
Miss Silverbill.

21:09.434 --> 21:11.353
[can clatters]

21:15.732 --> 21:18.235
[whooshing, rustling]

21:20.487 --> 21:22.572
[suspenseful music playing]

21:24.992 --> 21:26.785
[whooshing, rustling]

21:27.577 --> 21:28.829
[eerie chittering]

21:29.496 --> 21:32.708
- [breathing nervously]
- [whooshing]

21:32.791 --> 21:34.626
- [eerie music stab]
- [whooshing]

21:34.710 --> 21:35.585
What's going on?

21:35.669 --> 21:38.088
[eerie chittering]

21:38.171 --> 21:40.007
[Ho-jae] I think we fell into a trap.

21:40.507 --> 21:41.842
Get outta there right now.

21:41.925 --> 21:43.176
[gasps]

21:43.260 --> 21:44.219
[blades rasp]

21:44.303 --> 21:45.387
Get out! Run!

21:45.470 --> 21:47.973
[dramatic music playing]

21:48.056 --> 21:49.224
[blades rasp]

21:49.308 --> 21:51.059
[loud clattering]

21:53.937 --> 21:56.148
[grunting]

22:01.236 --> 22:03.238
- [grunts]
- [loud clattering]

22:07.409 --> 22:08.327
[grunts]

22:15.751 --> 22:17.836
[grunting]

22:19.421 --> 22:21.715
Miss Silverbill, where are you?
Are you all right?

22:24.718 --> 22:25.927
I'm on my way! Keep running!

22:26.011 --> 22:28.013
[dramatic music continues]

22:32.893 --> 22:34.394
[blades whooshing, rasping]

22:36.313 --> 22:37.564
[metallic clanking]

22:39.316 --> 22:41.401
[people snarling]

22:45.655 --> 22:48.658
[Chae-ok grunting]

22:52.079 --> 22:53.330
What's going on in there?

22:54.664 --> 22:57.084
Ah, it's Jang Ho-jae.
You gotta be kidding me.

23:00.462 --> 23:02.047
[bats clatter]

23:05.008 --> 23:07.594
[tense music playing]

23:10.555 --> 23:11.890
[dramatic music playing]

23:17.020 --> 23:18.480
[grunts]

23:21.817 --> 23:23.068
[people chittering]

23:37.999 --> 23:39.209
[Chae-ok] Follow me!

23:49.719 --> 23:52.639
[loud banging]

23:52.722 --> 23:55.142
[Ho-jae] What are those things?
Are they even human?

23:55.225 --> 23:56.935
[Chae-ok] We have to find a way
out of here.

23:57.018 --> 23:59.020
[both panting]

24:10.073 --> 24:11.408
From now on, this is my fight.

24:12.909 --> 24:13.910
What do you mean by that?

24:13.994 --> 24:16.455
I can't win against them
if you are holding me back.

24:16.538 --> 24:17.372
What?

24:21.710 --> 24:22.961
This might hurt a little.

24:25.922 --> 24:27.340
[gentle piano music playing]

24:30.427 --> 24:31.678
[chittering]

24:34.556 --> 24:35.891
[thud echoes]

24:36.683 --> 24:38.435
[coughing]

24:45.901 --> 24:46.902
[groans]

24:46.985 --> 24:48.570
[loud banging]

24:50.530 --> 24:52.449
[suspenseful music playing]

24:52.532 --> 24:54.159
[footsteps clattering]

24:54.242 --> 24:55.619
[chittering]

24:57.704 --> 24:58.830
[Ho-jae groans]

25:00.499 --> 25:01.374
[moans]

25:09.508 --> 25:11.384
[metallic scraping]

25:14.179 --> 25:16.264
[breathing heavily]

25:16.348 --> 25:18.350
[suspenseful music continues]

25:28.151 --> 25:29.569
Exactly who are you?

25:30.362 --> 25:31.196
It's you.

25:33.031 --> 25:33.865
Ho-jae.

25:35.659 --> 25:36.993
It's been so long.

25:37.077 --> 25:38.495
Ah, hold on.

25:39.496 --> 25:40.872
We met briefly last time.

25:43.416 --> 25:44.751
When I was attacking the lady.

25:46.670 --> 25:47.921
[music swells]

25:48.004 --> 25:50.006
[dramatic music playing]

25:50.882 --> 25:51.925
[Chae-ok grunts]

25:52.008 --> 25:54.010
[blades rasping]

26:01.810 --> 26:03.395
[reverential music playing]

26:06.064 --> 26:08.608
- [blades rasping]
- [blood squelching]

26:15.031 --> 26:17.033
[loud clattering]

26:21.496 --> 26:23.248
[dramatic music playing]

26:33.675 --> 26:34.801
[eerie chittering]

26:34.884 --> 26:36.303
[Chae-ok grunts]

26:45.437 --> 26:48.064
[blades rasping, whooshing]

26:52.819 --> 26:53.903
[blade slices]

26:56.489 --> 26:58.491
[music intensifies]

27:03.413 --> 27:05.415
[music subsides]

27:06.625 --> 27:08.752
[suspenseful music playing]

27:14.424 --> 27:16.635
[man 1] Are you the one
they call Silverbill?

27:16.718 --> 27:18.928
Tell me who the hell you are first.

27:20.347 --> 27:21.765
What are you bastards?

27:25.101 --> 27:27.145
Are you working with
whoever killed Madam Na?

27:28.104 --> 27:29.564
[metallic clicking]

27:29.648 --> 27:31.733
[clattering]

27:33.026 --> 27:35.028
[hissing]

27:36.613 --> 27:38.365
[coughing]

27:44.245 --> 27:45.080
[grunts]

27:49.334 --> 27:51.252
[Chae-ok grunting]

27:52.921 --> 27:53.963
[muffled grunt]

27:54.756 --> 27:55.882
[gasps]

27:55.965 --> 27:57.634
- [Chae-ok grunts]
- [breathing heavily]

28:01.221 --> 28:02.681
[gasping]

28:11.564 --> 28:12.816
[music fades]

28:12.899 --> 28:15.610
Listen here, you little bastard.

28:16.528 --> 28:18.947
What do you want with me,
and what was that army up there?

28:19.030 --> 28:20.323
Do you even remember?

28:22.659 --> 28:24.244
You were operated on.

28:25.662 --> 28:27.664
I'm just here to see whether or not you

28:29.499 --> 28:32.502
still have… any of your old memories.

28:39.759 --> 28:41.761
[squelching]

28:45.265 --> 28:47.267
[suspenseful music playing]

28:55.525 --> 28:56.568
[Ho-jae grunts]

28:57.902 --> 28:59.237
[groaning]

29:12.167 --> 29:13.042
[Yong-gil groans]

29:13.793 --> 29:15.545
[breathing heavily]

29:16.880 --> 29:18.465
They said they would stay away.

29:19.716 --> 29:21.342
Those bastards lied to us.

29:33.062 --> 29:33.897
[grunts]

29:39.152 --> 29:41.112
[grunting]

29:44.949 --> 29:46.034
[grunts]

29:48.453 --> 29:50.497
- [tense music playing]
- [groans]

29:54.793 --> 29:56.044
[groans]

30:00.590 --> 30:01.508
[groans]

30:02.425 --> 30:03.718
[moans]

30:03.802 --> 30:05.970
[breathing heavily]

30:06.054 --> 30:08.223
- [music fades]
- [Ho-jae groans]

30:08.306 --> 30:10.600
[breathing heavily]

30:10.683 --> 30:12.602
Seriously? I'm bored already.

30:12.685 --> 30:14.604
- [Ho-jae groans]
- Is that all you got?

30:17.899 --> 30:18.900
No, keep going.

30:21.861 --> 30:24.572
Give it to me, asshole. I'm not done yet.

30:27.283 --> 30:29.953
- [ominous music playing]
- [footsteps approaching]

30:39.838 --> 30:41.714
[Ho-jae groaning]

31:06.906 --> 31:08.658
Every single one of you

31:10.243 --> 31:11.411
is going to die tonight.

31:16.291 --> 31:17.625
[squelching]

31:17.709 --> 31:19.878
Hey, don't do it. Don't you dare.

31:19.961 --> 31:20.962
Stay away, asshole!

31:21.045 --> 31:22.297
[whispers] Jang Tae-sang.

31:22.380 --> 31:23.590
- [skin tears]
- [blood squelches]

31:23.673 --> 31:27.594
[high-pitched squealing]

31:27.677 --> 31:29.679
[panting]

31:30.638 --> 31:31.890
[coughing]

31:33.141 --> 31:35.143
[somber music playing]

31:39.063 --> 31:40.857
- [skin tearing]
- Ah! No, no!

31:42.358 --> 31:44.068
No! [groans]

31:46.362 --> 31:47.947
[Ho-jae whimpering]

31:49.782 --> 31:51.367
[breathing heavily]

31:51.451 --> 31:52.785
Stay with me, okay?

31:54.829 --> 31:56.331
Jang Tae-sang.

31:56.414 --> 31:57.624
[high-pitched squealing]

31:57.707 --> 31:59.000
Hey, don't die. Don't.

31:59.626 --> 32:00.627
Stay awake.

32:01.961 --> 32:03.379
Stay with me!

32:03.463 --> 32:04.464
[man 1] Finish it.

32:04.964 --> 32:06.591
[Ho-jae] You have to get up. No.

32:08.217 --> 32:10.178
No, please. Stay with me.

32:10.970 --> 32:12.931
[engine roaring]

32:18.645 --> 32:19.687
[stirring music playing]

32:19.771 --> 32:21.689
Ho-jae! Come on, hurry! Get in the car!

32:23.066 --> 32:24.817
[metallic clattering]

32:30.865 --> 32:33.326
[high-pitched squealing]

32:35.328 --> 32:36.329
[moans]

32:41.960 --> 32:43.711
- Go after them now!
- No, forget it.

32:46.089 --> 32:47.131
Just let them go.

32:51.719 --> 32:52.887
They'll soon find out…

32:55.014 --> 32:56.683
exactly what it is they rescued.

32:57.183 --> 32:59.185
[stirring music continues]

33:10.279 --> 33:11.489
[Yong-gil] Is she dead?

33:11.572 --> 33:12.949
Tell me, is the woman dead?

33:13.700 --> 33:15.493
Ah shit! Are you serious?

33:15.576 --> 33:17.578
- Why is this happening?
- Drive to the hospital now!

33:17.662 --> 33:20.164
- What? We can't do that!
- Hurry, floor it. She might not make it.

33:20.248 --> 33:21.749
[Yong-gil] Okay, I'm going. I'm going.

33:25.086 --> 33:26.462
- [gasps]
- [Ho-jae] What?

33:27.130 --> 33:28.756
- [gasping]
- [Ho-jae] Are you…

33:29.632 --> 33:30.466
Are you all right?

33:32.010 --> 33:33.761
[Seung-jo] She probably hasn't
fully recovered

33:33.845 --> 33:35.513
from her injury from two days ago.

33:35.596 --> 33:37.598
- Are you all right?
- [creature voice] I need to feed.

33:37.682 --> 33:40.643
[Seung-jo] Now she's lost
even more blood on top of that.

33:40.727 --> 33:44.772
She's not going to be able to resist
the hunger and thirst. She has to feed.

33:44.856 --> 33:47.025
[Chae-ok breathing heavily]

33:47.108 --> 33:49.902
- [Chae-ok's voice] I need to feed.
- [creature voice] I need to feed.

33:52.989 --> 33:55.491
You're losing a lot of blood.
We gotta stop the bleeding.

33:56.409 --> 34:00.038
[panting] Stop the car.
I said stop the car!

34:00.121 --> 34:01.330
- Pull over now!
- [Ho-jae] Stop!

34:01.414 --> 34:03.207
- What are you doing? Get off of me!
- Pull over!

34:03.291 --> 34:04.417
Do you have a death wish?

34:04.500 --> 34:06.044
- Let go!
- [Ho-jae] Calm down.

34:07.670 --> 34:09.088
[loud banging]

34:10.048 --> 34:12.216
[tires squealing]

34:18.514 --> 34:20.516
[eerie music playing]

34:26.856 --> 34:27.815
[Ho-jae groans]

34:28.608 --> 34:30.318
Hyung. Hyung.

34:31.986 --> 34:33.988
Hyung, are you okay?

34:35.114 --> 34:36.240
Hyung, wake up.

34:37.742 --> 34:38.826
[Ho-jae groans]

34:40.536 --> 34:41.996
[glass crunching]

34:51.964 --> 34:53.049
[stirring music playing]

34:53.132 --> 34:55.760
[creature voice] Feed me.
I'm hungry, and I need to feed.

34:55.843 --> 34:57.053
Feed me.

34:57.136 --> 34:58.346
I need to feed.

34:58.429 --> 34:59.430
Feed me.

35:00.431 --> 35:01.682
I'm hungry.

35:01.766 --> 35:03.267
Why aren't you feeding me?

35:04.185 --> 35:05.561
[moans] This is bad.

35:05.645 --> 35:06.729
[Ho-jae] Hey, wait.

35:11.317 --> 35:13.569
- [Chae-ok voice] I need to feed.
- [creature voice] Feed me.

35:13.653 --> 35:16.405
- What's wrong with you? Where you going?
- Get away from me!

35:16.489 --> 35:18.282
[Chae-ok whimpering]

35:19.659 --> 35:21.494
I… I'm sorry. Just stay away.

35:23.996 --> 35:25.998
[breathing shakily]

35:28.334 --> 35:29.252
Get away.

35:29.919 --> 35:30.837
Just don't…

35:31.796 --> 35:33.381
don't come any closer.

35:37.343 --> 35:39.804
You gotta get to a hospital!
You could die if you don't go!

35:39.887 --> 35:41.139
You don't understand!

35:41.222 --> 35:43.099
[sobs, whimpers]

35:43.182 --> 35:44.475
If I were to die…

35:47.145 --> 35:48.855
I could end up killing you first.

35:50.898 --> 35:54.527
I actually could end up attacking you
if you don't run right now.

35:54.610 --> 35:55.444
So, please…

35:58.322 --> 35:59.240
get out of here now.

35:59.323 --> 36:01.242
Please, go. Please.

36:01.325 --> 36:02.702
Please, please.

36:02.785 --> 36:04.453
[music fades]

36:08.207 --> 36:10.209
[emotional music playing]

36:10.293 --> 36:12.170
[Ho-jae] I don't know what came over me.

36:13.212 --> 36:14.172
But just now,

36:15.840 --> 36:17.675
a name popped into my head.

36:19.594 --> 36:20.720
Yoon Chae-ok.

36:44.869 --> 36:46.204
[Chae-ok sobs]

36:47.580 --> 36:49.290
[Chae-ok crying]

36:57.548 --> 36:58.966
[Chae-ok crying]

37:06.849 --> 37:08.851
[crying continues]

37:35.753 --> 37:37.255
[music fades]

37:51.227 --> 37:53.229
[mysterious music playing]

38:14.542 --> 38:15.376
[sighs]

38:23.676 --> 38:24.593
[exhales]

38:29.890 --> 38:31.892
[dramatic string music playing]

39:58.062 --> 40:00.064
[music fades]

40:01.148 --> 40:03.609
["Forever" by Daniel Kim
of wave to earth playing]

40:14.328 --> 40:17.832
♪ Stuck in my head
I've been searchin' for the reason ♪

40:20.876 --> 40:25.798
♪ Nameless longing
I've been waitin' for you for so long ♪

40:27.550 --> 40:31.929
♪ But got no direction
No matter I wanna reach you ♪

40:32.888 --> 40:36.267
♪ Another way you runnin'
Goin' on and on ♪

40:36.350 --> 40:38.644
♪ But need a way to get to you ♪

40:40.980 --> 40:43.065
♪ You ♪

40:43.732 --> 40:46.485
♪ You know I'm so stuck with you ♪

40:47.653 --> 40:49.613
♪ You ♪

40:50.448 --> 40:53.451
♪ Baby, I don't care at all ♪

40:53.534 --> 40:56.787
♪ You'll never know what I could do ♪

40:56.871 --> 40:59.707
♪ You'll never know
What we could have been ♪

40:59.790 --> 41:01.250
[music fades]
